          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2ff902554f85be7b4e73f9112238fa0cbeafd02cfa79676037076f26a40963f1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ba30ad3c66d4a59ad406975c649f396",
      "statement": "Middleware can declare a trace_policy (TracePolicy object) to customize what their hooks record in LangSmith spans. The factory resolves policies at call time via _node_trace_policy, allowing configure_trace_policy to set process-wide defaults that apply even to already-built agents.",
      "evidence": [
