    {
      "id": "claim_9668397eb706496d80edbc2cb42f07b9",
      "statement": "The factory creates a RunnableCallable wrapping both sync (model_node) and async (amodel_node) implementations for the model. At runtime, the appropriate variant is invoked based on context. Middleware can implement only sync, only async, or both; mismatches raise NotImplementedError.",
